<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .header { background-color: #2d3748; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer { margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #718096; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Welcome to Talent Pro Africa!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
            <p>Thank you for joining our waitlist. We're excited to have you on board!</p>
            <p>We'll notify you as soon as we launch our platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© {{year}} Talent Pro Africa. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>